              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThe section cards component displays a list of cards which can be added manually or generated automatically from child pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe second child page is missing from the generated cards because it has the\u00A0\u003Cem\u003EumbracoNaviHide\u003C/em\u003E\u00A0property set to true, which hides it from navigation.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
