            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2 class=\u0022govuk-heading-m\u0022\u003ELimit the width\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESection cards can also be added inside other layout blocks with narrower widths. The number of section cards on a row should adapt to the size of the parent element as well as the size of the browser viewport.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe next example shows section cards in a \u0027Three quarters\u0027 layout block, but not using a \u0027Nested box\u0027.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
