            "markup": "\u003Ch2 class=\u0022govuk-heading-m\u0022\u003ESetting the navigation aria-label\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe navigation aria-label can be set for the nav element using the \u003Cstrong\u003Enavigation-aria-label \u003C/strong\u003Eparameter.\u003Cbr\u003EThis is used to provide an accessible name for the navigation landmark that wraps the list of cards.\u003Cbr\u003EIf left empty, no aria-label attribute will be rendered.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
